    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_02",
      "hash64": "57E70015A01D8A7E",
      "text": "Sorry to put you all on the spot at the start of\\nclass, but let me ask you a quick question—\\r\\nDo you enjoy numbers, arithmetic, and the like?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_b_01_popup_01",
      "hash64": "1C7DF4F0B24454F1",
      "text": "Yeah!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_b_01_popup_02",
      "hash64": "1C7DF1F0B2444FD8",
      "text": "Sort of.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_01_popup_03",
      "hash64": "1C7DF2F0B244518B",
      "text": "Errr...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_03",
      "hash64": "57E70115A01D8C31",
      "text": "Oh, my. Hahaha. Thank you for your honest\\nresponses.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_04",
      "hash64": "57E70215A01D8DE4",
      "text": "Some of you may like numbers, and some may\\nnot. I think that makes a wonderful mix.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_05",
      "hash64": "57E70315A01D8F97",
      "text": "But no matter your opinion on math, I hope you\\nfind yourselves enjoying our lessons together!\\c\\nI’ll do my best to find a good way to match up\\nyour interests with all types of math lessons![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_06",
      "hash64": "57E70415A01D914A",
      "text": "Speaking of which, are you all caught up on your\\nstudies of Pokémon type matchups?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_07",
      "hash64": "57E70515A01D92FD",
      "text": "For example, Grass is strong against Water, and\\nWater is strong against Fire, correct?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_08",
      "hash64": "57E6F615A01D7980",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)], you seem to\\nbe\\r\\ngood\\r\\nwith\\r\\nPokémon,\\r\\nso\\r\\nlet\\r\\nme\\r\\nask\\r\\nyou this...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
