    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_09",
      "hash64": "57E6F715A01D7B33",
      "text": "Bearing in mind that Water is strong against Fire...\\nIf the move Water Gun hits a Fire-type Pokémon,\\r\\nwhat becomes of the move’s damage?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_b_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "27E4F980E00456F1",
      "text": "It’s cut in half",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_b_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "27E4F680E00451D8",
      "text": "It doesn’t change",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "27E4F780E004538B",
      "text": "It’s doubled",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_answer_01",
      "hash64": "1723D885F3F4473C",
      "text": "Oh, my. A little reverse thinking, I see! But I’d\\nprobably be in rough shape afterward if I got hit\\r\\nby something I was weak to. Wouldn’t you be?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_answer_02",
      "hash64": "1723DB85F3F44C55",
      "text": "A real hardy individual, I see! But I’d probably\\nbe in rough shape afterward if I got hit by\\r\\nsomething I was weak to. Wouldn’t you be?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_answer_03",
      "hash64": "1723DA85F3F44AA2",
      "text": "That’s right! I knew I could count on you for this\\nquestion, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_10",
      "hash64": "57EA8415A020A0A1",
      "text": "Using moves of a type that your opponent is\\nweak to is a supereffective tactic!\\c\\nIt multiplies the damage of those moves by two![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_11",
      "hash64": "57EA8315A0209EEE",
      "text": "On the other hand, using moves of a type that\\nyour opponent is resistant to isn’t very effective.\\r\\nIt divides the damage of your moves by two.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_12",
      "hash64": "57EA8215A0209D3B",
      "text": "Haha! I don’t mean to encroach on Ms. Dendra’s\\nbattle studies territory, of course, but I thought\\r\\nit best to use a lively topic as an example.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_13",
      "hash64": "57EA8115A0209B88",
      "text": "That can make math fun even for those of you\\nwho don’t much like the subject, don’t you think?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_14",
      "hash64": "57EA8815A020A76D",
      "text": "Oh, my. Is that the bell? I suppose that’s all for\\nnow. What a shame...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_b_01_math_15",
      "hash64": "57EA8715A020A5BA",
      "text": "I’m looking forward to seeing you all in the next\\nclass. I hope you’re looking forward to it, too![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
